{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_aa02906e011f9f2d3ca21eca", "claim_ids": ["claim_a21b5ab11c948e265a308585", "claim_f220f942c7976b8b947afe61"], "query_ids": ["q_295"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_a21b5ab11c948e265a308585", "quote": "The sticker price of Tucson SUV, Hyundai’s best-selling model in the U.S. market, starts at $28,705. When applying a 25 percent tariff based on a simple calculation, the tariff would be roughly $7,200", "url": "https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/business/hyundai-in-a-catch-22-as-it-absorbs-us-tariffs-while-toyota-volkswagen-benefit-from-deals/12005889", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai", "duty_rate": "25 percent tariff"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f220f942c7976b8b947afe61", "quote": "Hyundai Motor is bearing mounting costs on an unprecedented scale due to the hefty 25 percent tariff imposed by the Donald Trump administration", "url": "https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/business/hyundai-in-a-catch-22-as-it-absorbs-us-tariffs-while-toyota-volkswagen-benefit-from-deals/12005889", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor", "tariff_program": "hefty 25 percent tariff imposed by the Donald Trump administration", "duty_rate": "25 percent"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6ff968a83877e8e2c9d05bde", "claim_ids": ["claim_f06e6eebac352f909c42817b", "claim_fe19d13fc32f82dd3edb5a52"], "query_ids": ["q_296"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_f06e6eebac352f909c42817b", "quote": "In 2025, President Donald Trump imposed 25% tariffs on U.S. imports of automobiles and certain automobile parts under Section 232.", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12545", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_fe19d13fc32f82dd3edb5a52", "quote": "But, according to Euisun Chung, executive chair of Hyundai, it was a meeting with Trump in Seoul back in 2019 that inspired those Georgia plans. The flattery earned Chung and South Korea a tariff exemption.", "url": "https://gfmag.com/capital-raising-corporate-finance/hyundai-avoids-trump-tariffs", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai", "tariff_program": "tariff exemption"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_be9e98f07753b2a9c26c0b36", "claim_ids": ["claim_8d181378560e6bbaf8deff60", "claim_ce986aa363a97e10c290f08c"], "query_ids": ["q_297"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_8d181378560e6bbaf8deff60", "quote": "South Korea is hoping to negotiate a reduction in the 25% tariffs Trump has imposed on South Korean goods (since suspended for 90 days) or give exemptions to a separate 25% levy imposed on imported vehicles and steel.", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/autos-transportation/hyundai-steels-6-bln-us-investment-draws-investor-ire-tests-seouls-tariff-2025-04-22", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "separate 25% levy", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ce986aa363a97e10c290f08c", "quote": "South Korea is hoping to negotiate a reduction in the 25% tariffs Trump has imposed on South Korean goods (since suspended for 90 days) or give exemptions to a separate 25% levy imposed on imported vehicles and steel.", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/autos-transportation/hyundai-steels-6-bln-us-investment-draws-investor-ire-tests-seouls-tariff-2025-04-22", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "25% tariffs", "duty_rate": "25%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_5f37342aaa561ec6d4ab57b0", "claim_ids": ["claim_4eae5564ea3331360cddaf93", "claim_f23cdbb154359e566856ab49"], "query_ids": ["q_297"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_4eae5564ea3331360cddaf93", "quote": "\"This investment is a clear demonstration that tariffs very strongly work,\" Trump said. \"Hyundai will be producing steel in America and making its cars in America and as a result they will not have to pay any tariffs.", "url": "https://www.manufacturingdive.com/news/hyundai-investment-us-tariffs-trump-steel-louisiana/743377", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai", "tariff_program": "tariffs very strongly work"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f23cdbb154359e566856ab49", "quote": "For Hyundai Motor Group, the investment plan has not gone any further beyond the flashy announcement for now, as South Korea is hoping to negotiate a reduction in the 25% tariffs Trump has imposed on South Korean goods (since suspended for 90 days) or give exemptions to a separate 25% levy imposed on imported vehicles and steel.", "url": "https://www.reuters.com/business/autos-transportation/hyundai-steels-6-bln-us-investment-draws-investor-ire-tests-seouls-tariff-2025-04-22", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor Group", "reported_policy_status": "not gone any further beyond the flashy announcement for now"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_b2d32a4180b081e78eb514c7", "claim_ids": ["claim_22db82fb02b873f711749b9f", "claim_42b0cc400d3076046cc32cf5"], "query_ids": ["q_298"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_22db82fb02b873f711749b9f", "quote": "KIA HAS ANOTHER PLANT IN SLOVAKIA, AND HERE IN THE U.S. AT A MANUFACTURING PLANT IN WEST POINT IN GEORGIA, WHERE THE CARS ARE ASSEMBLED WOULD OF COURSE BE EXEMPT FROM TARIFFS.", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWzZYMAbgJw", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "KIA", "facility": "MANUFACTURING PLANT IN WEST POINT IN GEORGIA", "tariff_program": "TARIFFS"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_42b0cc400d3076046cc32cf5", "quote": "Those tariffs would hit Asian companies like South Korea-based Kia especially hard, and put jobs at risk in communities like West Point.", "url": "https://www.kuaf.com/2018-07-27/trumps-proposed-auto-tariffs-threaten-kia-plant-in-georgia", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "South Korea-based Kia"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_ccffa54f871938f0be66ece0", "claim_ids": ["claim_3d72bb3f09894ba8583d30df", "claim_42b0cc400d3076046cc32cf5"], "query_ids": ["q_298"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3d72bb3f09894ba8583d30df", "quote": "THE CARS IN THE U.S. ARE NOT ARE. NOT TARIFF. THE ENGINES ARE BUILT HERE. THE CARS ARE ASSEMBLED HERE.", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWzZYMAbgJw", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "TARIFF"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_42b0cc400d3076046cc32cf5", "quote": "Those tariffs would hit Asian companies like South Korea-based Kia especially hard, and put jobs at risk in communities like West Point.", "url": "https://www.kuaf.com/2018-07-27/trumps-proposed-auto-tariffs-threaten-kia-plant-in-georgia", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "South Korea-based Kia"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_3716815c938531897c24a253", "claim_ids": ["claim_9fd4dbf380f168f762fdd8a6", "claim_c70e2134c171b53d9b2b5242"], "query_ids": ["q_298"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_9fd4dbf380f168f762fdd8a6", "quote": "PRESIDENT TRUMP'S 25% AUTO TARIFFS AND THE JAPANESE CAR MAKER IS IT'LL MOVE PRODUCTION OF FIVE DOOR CIVIC HYBRID FROM JAPAN TO INDIANA.", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWzZYMAbgJw", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "PRESIDENT TRUMP'S 25% AUTO TARIFFS", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_c70e2134c171b53d9b2b5242", "quote": "While import duties on South Korean-built vehicles fell from 25% to 15% as part of a November 2025 trade deal, there's no doubt that tariffs expose companies like Hyundai and Kia to major cost disadvantages.", "url": "https://www.military.com/how-kia-quietly-built-the-most-tariff-proof-car-factory-in-america", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25% to 15%", "announcement_date": "November 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a12981220d2c9853972bb851", "claim_ids": ["claim_3931b232a7a58f9ed19c3af3", "claim_df3a7c8630aeb9ca54fc1ff3"], "query_ids": ["q_299"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3931b232a7a58f9ed19c3af3", "quote": "President Trump surprised the world this week when he announced a detente on tariffs with Europe. But new U.S. tariffs on imported cars and parts still loom.", "url": "https://www.npr.org/2018/07/27/631839199/trumps-proposed-auto-tariffs-threaten-kia-plant-in-georgia", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "new U.S. tariffs on imported cars and parts", "legal_authority": "President Trump"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_df3a7c8630aeb9ca54fc1ff3", "quote": "While import duties on South Korean-built vehicles fell from 25% to 15% as part of a November 2025 trade deal, there's no doubt that tariffs expose companies like Hyundai and Kia to major cost disadvantages.", "url": "https://www.military.com/how-kia-quietly-built-the-most-tariff-proof-car-factory-in-america", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25% to 15%", "announcement_date": "November 2025", "reported_policy_status": "fell from 25% to 15%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_19ae95af038b68ab7a4dda63", "claim_ids": ["claim_490ebed0b3a7abc4269f8064", "claim_7df5f5983e29704d00399b2f"], "query_ids": ["q_299"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_490ebed0b3a7abc4269f8064", "quote": "KIA HAS ANOTHER PLANT IN SLOVAKIA, AND HERE IN THE U.S. AT A MANUFACTURING PLANT IN WEST POINT IN GEORGIA, WHERE THE CARS ARE ASSEMBLED WOULD OF COURSE BE EXEMPT FROM TARIFFS.", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wWzZYMAbgJw", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "KIA", "facility": "MANUFACTURING PLANT IN WEST POINT IN GEORGIA", "tariff_program": "TARIFFS"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_7df5f5983e29704d00399b2f", "quote": "Kia was already reeling from US tariffs when the new HMGMA project opened, and such tariffs apparently cost the company more than $2.3 billion in 2025 alone.", "url": "https://www.military.com/how-kia-quietly-built-the-most-tariff-proof-car-factory-in-america", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Kia", "duty_rate": "$2.3 billion", "effective_date": "2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_5acc6887206274d4d1deafa4", "claim_ids": ["claim_388815c909f649b5d8b40400", "claim_bcd4f8f9df02215f2ed9926b"], "query_ids": ["q_302"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_388815c909f649b5d8b40400", "quote": "Hyundai Motor Group $HYMTF ( ▼ 7.44% ) is widening the scope of its manufacturing footprint in the U.S. as the industry braces for the 25% auto tariffs scheduled to go into effect on April 3.", "url": "https://news.dealershipguy.com/p/hyundai-s-new-georgia-megaplant-opens-as-u-s-tariffs-loom-2025-03-31", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor Group", "tariff_program": "25% auto tariffs", "effective_date": "April 3"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_bcd4f8f9df02215f2ed9926b", "quote": "This plant couldn’t come at a better time than now…because definitely all the cars that we would produce here are going to be exempted from any tariffs,” stated Euisun Chung, Hyundai Motor Group’s Executive Chairman.", "url": "https://news.dealershipguy.com/p/hyundai-s-new-georgia-megaplant-opens-as-u-s-tariffs-loom-2025-03-31", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "Hyundai Motor Group", "tariff_program": "exempted from any tariffs"}}]}]}

